02:44:32.849 database C:\MapleCW\maplecw.db
02:44:32.849 NOT AUTHENTICATED: a migration seed is a u32, so it identifies a pending
02:44:32.849   migration rather than proving who is on the far end. It is single-use.
02:44:32.849 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
02:44:32.849   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
02:44:32.849   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
02:44:32.849   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
02:44:32.849   With it on, this channel answers: the migration hello with a SetField
02:44:32.849   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
02:44:32.849   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
02:44:32.849   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
02:44:32.849   script Say, 0x0104 with the NPC shop, and 0x00D2 with a channel migration.
02:44:32.849   CONFIRMED on a real client: the dressed character, the bag and its 125 slots,
02:44:32.849   NPC dialogue, mobs spawning and moving, an unequip that survives a map change.
02:44:32.849   NOT yet seen on screen: the shop counter, the quest journal, the channel
02:44:32.849   switch. Dropping an item is refused on purpose - there is nowhere to put it.
